speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Before next month, could this one be enough for today?\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"B\", \"text\": \"You worked hard on it.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Good. Let me hear that without an assignment afterward.\"}\n      ],\n      \"decision\": \"retained\",\n      \"mechanism\": \"A seeks reassurance that the completed effort is sufficient without making it a prelude to further demands.\",\n      \"confusableConcept\": \"Seeking praise for quality would ask whether the painting is good; A asks whether doing this much is enough.\",\n      \"distinguishingEvidence\": \"A3 explicitly asks for one painting to be 'enough for today', and A5 excludes an added assignment.\",\n      \"alternativeComparison\": \"Alternative a resists productivity advice about a creative output; alternative b asks B to count endurance instead of a flawless performance.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Retained unchanged after rereading. B4 supplies the recognition A wanted in part, and A5 develops it by specifying reassurance without appended work. The final condition depends on both B4's praise and B2's earlier advice.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"B4 recognizes effort without explicitly saying it was enough, so A's objective remains actively unresolved.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"D100-single-b\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"0e1b26e05d4b4e8b3dd0e86e8c643ddfb9f7c77002054e18f01a7d784e2189cc\",\n      \"firstPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\"score\": 5, \"evidence\": \"A1 asks whether staying through the speech was enough; A3 rejects completeness as the relevant measure.\"},\n          \"responseLogic\": {\"score\": 5, \"evidence\": \"A3 redirects B2's missing paragraph; A5 accepts B4's recognition of staying.\"},\n          \"relationship\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"B2 initially evaluates performance, then B4 adopts A's endurance criterion.\"},\n          \"heightening\": {\"score\": 2, \"evidence\": \"A5 thank